1
00:00:00,284 --> 00:00:03,484
(Dr Lorvis:)Welcome to
my Fortress of Solitude.

2
00:00:03,487 --> 00:00:06,217
(Dr Lorvis:)This is where I go
to get away from...

3
00:00:06,223 --> 00:00:08,893
(Dr Lorvis:)all my other solitude.

4
00:00:10,728 --> 00:00:12,498
(Howard:)Oh, come on.
It's a replica.

5
00:00:12,496 --> 00:00:14,066
(Man:)Original.

6
00:00:14,064 --> 00:00:17,964
(Howard:)Oh, I think I just
cheated on my wife.

7
00:00:19,937 --> 00:00:21,837
The gun from Hellboy?

8
00:00:21,839 --> 00:00:23,109
(Dr Lorvis:)Yup.

9
00:00:23,107 --> 00:00:24,307
(Raj:)How did you get it?

10
00:00:24,308 --> 00:00:25,508
(Dr Lorvis:)Bought it at auction.

11
00:00:25,509 --> 00:00:27,809
(Raj:)Oh, I was hoping
for a juicy tidbit

12
00:00:27,812 --> 00:00:30,742
(Raj:)about Ron Perlman's testicles.

13
00:00:30,748 --> 00:00:34,418
WOMAN:
Oliver! I'm going to play bingo!

14
00:00:34,418 --> 00:00:36,288
(Dr Lorvis:)Okay, Mother. Have fun.

15
00:00:36,287 --> 00:00:37,617
Still lives with his mom.

16
00:00:37,621 --> 00:00:40,421
(Howard:)Yikes, right?
(laughs)

17
00:00:40,424 --> 00:00:43,994
(Raj:)Yeah, I'm not quite
sure how to respond.

18
00:00:45,629 --> 00:00:47,799
Wow, Donkey Kong!

19
00:00:47,798 --> 00:00:49,968
This-this was my game
when I was a kid!

20
00:00:49,967 --> 00:00:50,767
(Sheldon:)Because it's a story

21
00:00:50,768 --> 00:00:52,768
(Sheldon:)of a pretty blonde girl

22
00:00:52,770 --> 00:00:56,000
(Sheldon:)tirelessly pursued
by a small, oddly-shaped man?

23
00:00:57,208 --> 00:01:00,848
(Leonard:)No, because I liked it.

